      "text": "on physics and AI—\n\ntoday, all theoretical physicists are computational—they code simulations &amp; draw theory from them\n\ntmrw, all theoretical physicists will be AI physicists—AI will derive laws of physics from observational data, and humans will filter them to find the good laws",
